# SKIP SILENT: a held note on T1 plays on while its LEVEL is up; at no level for half a second (and
# nothing else using T1) its voice stops; heard again, new notes play as ever. An influence route
# from T1 keeps it playing, unheard or not.
wait 300
key 0 down
wait 200
expect voices 1
expect skipped 0
settp 1 LEVEL 0
wait 300
expect voices 1
wait 400
expect skipped 1
expect voices 0
key 0 up
key 0 down
wait 100
expect voices 0
settp 1 LEVEL 100
wait 50
expect skipped 0
key 0 up
wait 20
key 0 down
wait 100
expect voices 1
key 0 up
wait 2000
